{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["腰带的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说：“你去买一条麻布腰带束在腰间，不可让它沾水。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我照耶和华的话买了腰带，束在腰间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华又对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“拿着你买来的腰带去幼发拉底河边，把它藏在那里的岩缝中。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，我照耶和华的吩咐把腰带藏在那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["多日后，耶和华对我说：“去幼发拉底河边取回我吩咐你藏在那里的腰带。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我就去幼发拉底河边把所藏的腰带挖出来，但腰带已经腐烂，毫无用处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“耶和华如此说，‘我也要这样消灭犹大的骄傲和耶路撒冷的狂妄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["这邪恶的百姓拒绝听我的话，一意孤行，跟随、供奉、祭拜其他神明，他们将像这腰带一样毫无用处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我本想使以色列人和犹大人紧靠着我，就像腰带紧贴在人的腰间，让他们做我的子民，使我声名远扬、得到赞美和尊崇，他们却不肯听从。这是耶和华说的。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["“因此，你告诉他们，以色列的上帝耶和华说，‘每个瓦瓶都要盛满酒。’若他们说，‘难道我们不知道每个瓦瓶都要盛满酒吗？’"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你就告诉他们，‘耶和华说：我要使这片土地上所有的居民，包括坐在大卫宝座上的君王以及祭司、先知和耶路撒冷人都酩酊大醉；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我要使他们彼此撞得粉碎，就算父子也要彼此相撞；我要毁灭他们，决不留情，也不心慈手软。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"你们要留心听，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不可傲慢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华已发言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趁着你们的上帝耶和华还未使黑暗来临，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们还未在漆黑的山上绊倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把荣耀归给祂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否则，祂必使你们期望的光明变为幽冥和黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们不肯听，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心会为你们的骄傲暗自哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我双眼痛哭，泪流满面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的羊群将要被掳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和华让我对君王和太后说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“从宝座上下来吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们头上华美的王冠将要掉落。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"南部的城邑将被围困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能解围，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大人都要被掳，无一幸免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"举目看看那些从北方来的敌人吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从前交托给你的群羊——你引以为荣的群羊如今在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华让你扶植的盟友来统治你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你还有什么话可说？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像分娩的妇人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也许你在想：“为什么这些事发生在我身上？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的裙子被撕破，你遭受蹂躏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因为你罪大恶极。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实人能改变他们的肤色吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子能改变它们的斑点吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这作恶成性的人怎能行善呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我要驱散你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像旷野的风吹散碎秸一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你应得的报应，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我量给你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你把我忘记，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信靠假神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要把你的裙子掀到你的脸上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人见到你的羞耻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在山上和田野间与偶像通奸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发出淫语浪声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见了你的可憎行为。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你什么时候才肯自洁呢？”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}